<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIA LISTED TERAPIA HAD HIGHER PROFIT LAST YEAR.</title>
<headline>ROMANIA LISTED TERAPIA HAD HIGHER PROFIT LAST YEAR.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>					  (billion of leu unless stated)</p>
<p> Gross profit			    14.65     vs    11.69</p>
<p> Net profit				 8.81     vs     6.77</p>
<p> Turnover				  91.60     vs    63.90</p>
<p> Fixed assets			    59.31     vs    53.45</p>
<p> Working capital			 43.69     vs    29.78</p>
<p> Total assets			   109.65     vs    87.89</p>
<p> Share capital			   41.33     vs    41.33</p>
<p> Total debts			     35.48     vs    28.34</p>
<p> Total dividends			  4.82     vs    n.a.</p>
<p> Dividend per share - net	    105 lei   vs    n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE -- Terapia is a private pharmaceuticals company listed on the Bucharest stock exchange's first tier. Data, reported to the bourse, are in nominal terms and in line with Romanian accounting standards. ($=7,089 lei)</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
